== port service --help excerpt ==
Manage machine-bound secrets, services, and sandboxes

Usage: port service [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  secret  Manage machine-bound secret references
  apply   Store a service or sandbox definition under the resolved runtime owner
  list    List stored service and sandbox definitions for a machine
  status  Inspect one stored service or sandbox definition
  stop    Set a stored service or sandbox definition to the stopped desired state
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Load a Port model from a TOML file instead of using the built-in sample
  -h, --help           Print help

